    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../ConfigurableReactiveWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.context.reactive\"><code>ConfigurableReactiveWebApplicationContext</code></a> that accepts annotated classes as\ninput - in particular <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Configuration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Configuration</code></a>-annotated classes, but also\nplain <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/stereotype/Component.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.stereotype\"><code>@Component</code></a> classes and JSR-330 compliant classes using\n<code>javax.inject</code> annotations.",
