      "translation": "接受注解类作为输入的<a href=\"../../../server/reactive/context/ReactiveWebServerApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.reactive.context\"><code>ReactiveWebServerApplicationContext</code></a>——特别是带有<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Configuration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Configuration</code></a>注解的类，但也包括普通的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/stereotype/Component.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.stereotype\"><code>@Component</code></a>类和符合 JSR-330 规范并使用<code>javax.inject</code>注解的类。",
